stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_compute_digest: fork_digest = compute_fork_digest(genesis_validators_root, epoch)
    q_compute_digest --> q_check_next_fork: check if future fork is planned
    q_check_next_fork --> q_set_same: no future fork planned
    q_check_next_fork --> q_set_next: future fork planned
    q_set_same --> q_build_enr: next_fork_version = current_fork_version, next_fork_epoch = FAR_FUTURE_EPOCH
    q_set_next --> q_check_bpo: next_fork_version = planned fork version
    q_check_bpo --> q_set_next_regular: regular fork / next_fork_version changes
    q_check_bpo --> q_set_next_bpo: BPO fork only / next_fork_version unchanged
    q_set_next_regular --> q_build_enr: next_fork_epoch = planned epoch
    q_set_next_bpo --> q_build_enr: next_fork_epoch = planned epoch
    q_build_enr --> q_add_nfd: compute nfd = ForkDigest of next fork
    q_add_nfd --> [*]: return ENRForkID + nfd
